(a) Unless otherwise noted, it is unlawful for any person to operate an ATV:
(1) In a careless, reckless or negligent manner or heedlessly in disregard of the rights or safety of others, or in a manner so as to endanger, or be likely to endanger, or cause injury or damage to any person or property;
(2) On a public road right-of-way;
(3) In a manner so as to violate the city's ordinances against loud and unnecessary noises (section 18-4(a));
(4) On private property without the express permission to do so by the owner and occupant of the property;
