(7) On any residential lot within the corporate city limits that is less than two acres in size;
(8) In a manner that causes erosion or sedimentation to enter a state water or an adjoining property;
(9) Without the operator and any passenger(s) wearing an approved motorcycle helmet.
(Ord. of 3-8-2018)

